 be he comments  that he can grab kaido's flame clouds if  he can't force the island back thus it  looks like he's considering removing  kaido's flame clouds and sending the  island plummeting if he has to since at  least then the people of the flower  capital his people might survive  especially if yamato deals with those  weapons or is doing a great job of  building tension here i can only imagine  how insane this will be in the anime  with all these top tier fights going on  at the same time and in the background  the time limit of the island hitting the  capital is fast approaching this is a  great moment for momo as well as he's  completely manned up here saying this  island will not destroy the flower  capital while i still draw bread this is  a far cry from the crybaby he  understandably used to be after all he  is still very young at least mentally  right now now yeah he's still probably  afraid but he's willing to sacrifice his  life before he abandons his people he's  showing here that he's truly a great  leader now we rejoin the fight between  queen and sanji suddenly queen starts  launching attacks that sanji's brothers  use we got laser beams from the eyes the  electricity that accompanies the move  henry blazer an amazing name for a move  by the way and so on queen laughs at our  blonde cook saying he wanted to show  sanji all those moves after he used the  suit to morph as we could have guessed  he views judges sons as the combination  of judge's scientific work he wanted  sanji to put the suit on so bad so he  could beat the combination of judge's  science and prove he's the better  fighter and more importantly i think for  queen the better scientist he clearly  has an intense rivalry with the judge  wishing that he could have shown him  once and for all that judge's technology  can't hold a candle to queen's own  technology and while queen is in his own  world attributing all of this meaning to  this battle sanji simply says it has  nothing to do with him as we know sanji  doesn't want to be connected to judge so  everything queen's saying literally  means nothing to him if anything it just  makes him angry i think it's hilarious  how they're on completely different  pages here if sanji beats queen now  queen might attribute it to judge's  technology instead of to sanji as an  individual which would no doubt be very  annoying to sanji however hopefully by  the time the battle is over sanji will  be able to make queen take him seriously  as an individual for now though queen  looks to be in the lead and controlling  the temple of the fight he says he was  playing dumb earlier and in reality he  dug up everything there is to know about  germa's science or at least he thinks he  did he insists that his arsenal can  replicate anything the brothers can do  thinking that it all boils down to  science and technology however as we  know in one piece individual will is  huge and overlooking that in this case  sanji's individual will will no doubt  lead the queen's downfall as queen is  pummeling sanji sanji kicks through his  mechanical arm breaking it queen is  clearly surprised and upset calling  sanji a dirty brat a beat up sanji then  gets up and says he warned queen about  mentioning judge and the others in front  of him you know things are gonna get  crazy right about now with sanji  bringing up his prior warning queen is  like you think you can control what i  say and sanji answers that question with  a kick i love seeing how composed  sanji's stances look in between kicks he  looks so light on his feet which is a  great contrast to the clearly heavy and  overweight queen and at this point you  could tell that sanji's attacks are  clearly delivering some real pain to  queen it's at this point sanji mentions  that the difference between them is  their resolve not science or technology  sanji has accepted his fate and as a  result he's not the same man queen  fought on the live floor then we  shouldn't be surprised but it's still  pretty crazy to see queen activates  invisibility a power we know well from  sanji's suit queen is taunting him  saying alright show me how you've  changed this is such a great fight for  sanji because we know he has had issues  with his family and queen takes all of  their powers and combines them within  himself thus he can serve as the perfect  symbolic outlet for sanji to take out  his frustrations about his family credit  goes to oda for how well thought out his  matchups are it's not just about  relative strength levels they're well  constructed thematically as well anyways  back to the fight and sanji disappears  to queen's shock queen decides it's  because he's moving faster than the eye  can see so he'll just wait until sanji  runs out of stamina at this point we see  a mouse running into the battlefield and  this mouse is the chuji that the lady  was looking for she's chased him here  and we finally get the answers that  we've been looking for queen recognizes  her as osome the lady that refused his  summons not once or twice but dozens of  times wow that is a lot of rejections he  says she even refused him today even  though she seems fine according to him  queen clearly upset by all her  rejections says he guesses he hasn't  dished out enough divine punishment yet  and tells her to have some more as his  invisible self moves in to hurt her  before he can do it though sanji steps  in he comments on his exoskeleton  enhanced strength and speed he'll use  them all to improve his attack his  exoskeleton paired with his armament  haki training means his legs should be  able to withstand way hotter flames than  before the increased heat is combined  with increased speed and weight behind  the kick and so its attack will be on a  whole other level that's the science  behind this new powerful attack there's  also an emotional element too though  sanji realizes that it was queen using  his invisibility who hit the woman  before not sanji this explains why queen  told her to have some more before his  attack implying he already dished out  some of his so-called divine punishment  to her now sanji captures that rage he's  feeling towards someone who would hit a  woman like osume and channels it into  the attack as well he calls queen trash  as the physical and emotional  ingredients are there for an ultra  powerful attack he lands the attack  bringing queen no longer invisible down  to the ground i love how he just knocks  the invisibility right out of him osume  is shocked to see queen suddenly show up  and sanji continues with the merciless  attacks kick after kick after kick and  so on it's such a satisfying sequence of  attacks because in a way it's like he's  taking out all of his frustrations about  his family about being blackmailed about  queen's own sickening behavior and  channeling it into the onslaught of  kicks combine that with his new physical  power up and you get such an epic moment  sanji is a monster no doubt but not an  evil monster the last panel finishes  with what looks like a definitive kick  and queen blasts off like team rocket  let me know do you think that the fight  is over i would totally be satisfied if  this was the end here sanji's name was  cleared the one responsible was punished  we got to see sanji's power up and yeah  i don't know what else i'd want to see  from this fight i think oda pretty much  covered it all as always let me know  what you thought of this chapter and who  your mvp was i think sanji is the pretty  obvious choice here he was amazing this  chapter there's absolutely no doubt  about that if you did enjoy this review  and want to keep them coming you know  what to do channel the pyroking within  and smash that like button with no mercy  remember smashing that like button is  pyroking energy and passing is orochi  energy so choose wisely if you haven't  make this the video you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications or you w